{"metadata":{"name":"Sunan Ibn Majah","section":{"6":"Chapters Regarding Funerals"},"section_detail":{"6":{"hadithnumber_first":1433,"hadithnumber_last":1637,"arabicnumber_first":1433,"arabicnumber_last":1637,"name_native":"كتاب الجنائز"}}},"hadiths":[{"hadithnumber":1563,"arabicnumber":1563,"text":"حدثنا عبد الله بن سعيد، حدثنا حفص بن غياث، عن ابن جريج، عن سليمان بن موسى، عن جابر، قال نهى رسول الله صلى الله عليه وسلم ان يكتب على القبر شىء","grades":[{"name":"Al-Albani","grade":"Sahih"},{"name":"Muhammad Fouad Abd al-Baqi","grade":"Sahih"},{"name":"Zubair Ali Zai","grade":"Hasan"}],"reference":{"book":6,"hadith":131}}]}